"The photos are copied into the library; the originals in Photos or Files are left as they are." = "照片會拷貝到圖庫；「照片」或「檔案」中的原始照片保持不變。";
"The photos are copied into the library; the originals on the camera or card are left as they are." = "照片會拷貝到照片庫中；相機或記憶卡上的原件保持不變。";
"The photos in view are scored." = "會為檢視中的照片評估分數。";
"The processor does the work." = "The processor does the work.";
"The scan skips any file or folder with one of these names, wherever it is in %@'s library folders, and everything inside it. * stands for any text and ? for one character; capitals do not matter. Photos already in the library stay there, but their files show as missing." = "掃描會略過名稱與下列任一名稱相符的檔案或資料夾（無論它位於 %@ 的照片庫資料夾中的哪個位置），以及其中的所有內容。* 代表任意文字，? 代表單一字元；不分大小寫。已在照片庫中的照片會保留，但其檔案會顯示為遺失。";
"The search model is installed: describe a photo to find it." = "搜尋模型已安裝：描述一張照片即可尋找。";
"The server can find the faces in a user's photos and group them into people, which they name on their own devices. Faces are personal data, so this is off for everyone until you turn it on for them, one person at a time. They can delete everything found, from their devices." = "伺服器可以找出使用者照片中的人臉並將其歸為不同的人物，使用者可在自己的裝置上為其命名。人臉屬於個人資料，因此對所有人預設為關閉，直到你逐一為他們啟用。使用者可以在自己的裝置上刪除所有已找到的內容。";
"The server can't say how much it stores: %@" = "伺服器無法告知儲存量：%@";
"The server has a library already" = "伺服器已有照片庫";
"The server never changes, moves or deletes the photos. With writing on, it adds and updates .xmp sidecar files beside them — but it cannot write there now: %@" = "伺服器絕不會變更、移動或刪除這些照片。啟用寫入後，它會在照片旁新增並更新 .xmp 附屬檔案 — 但目前無法在那裡寫入：%@";
"The server never changes, moves or deletes the photos. With writing on, it adds and updates .xmp sidecar files beside them. Mount the folder read-write, with the server user allowed to write, before turning this on." = "伺服器絕不會變更、移動或刪除這些照片。啟用寫入後，它會在照片旁新增並更新 .xmp 附屬檔案。啟用之前，請以讀寫方式掛載該資料夾，並允許伺服器使用者寫入。";
"The server signed this device out, so nothing can be sent. Removing the library from this device loses what hasn't been sent. Signing in again brings the rest back from the server." = "伺服器已讓此裝置登出，因此無法傳送任何內容。從此裝置移除照片庫會遺失尚未傳送的內容。重新登入後，其餘內容會從伺服器還原。";
"The server will look at the faces in %@'s photos and group them into people, which they name on their own devices. What it finds stays on this server, and %@ can delete all of it from their devices (Forget All Faces). Only do this if they agree." = "伺服器將檢視 %@ 照片中的人臉並將其歸為不同的人物，使用者可在自己的裝置上為其命名。找到的內容只會保存在此伺服器上，%@ 可以在其裝置上全部刪除（「清除所有人臉」）。請在對方同意後再這麼做。";
"The server's" = "伺服器的";
"Their devices are signed out and they can no longer sign in. Their library and photo files stay on the server, in its data folder, until you delete them by hand." = "其裝置會登出，且無法再登入。其照片庫和照片檔案會保留在伺服器的資料資料夾中，直到你手動將其刪除。";
"Their edits, ratings and keywords are replaced with the catalog's." = "它們的編輯、評分與關鍵字會被目錄中的內容取代。";
"Their photos and the keywords below them come together under one keyword." = "它們的照片與下層關鍵字將合併到同一個關鍵字下。";
"Theme" = "主題";
"There are no presets in these files." = "這些檔案中沒有預設集。";
"There is no model file to install" = "There is no model file to install";
"There is no user %@." = "沒有名為 %@ 的使用者。";
"These models were trained on collections of public photos of people; their makers publish them for general use. What they find in your photos stays on this computer unless you choose to share it with your own server. You can forget it all at any time. Naming a person writes their name on the photos they are in." = "這些模型是用公開的人物照片集訓練的，其作者將它們公開發布供一般使用。除非你選擇與自己的伺服器共用，否則在你的照片中找到的內容只會保留在這台電腦上。你可以隨時將其全部清除。為人物命名會把名字寫入他們所在的照片。";
"They can be restored from Recently Deleted until it is emptied." = "清空「最近刪除」之前，可以從中還原照片。";
"They move to Recently Deleted and can be restored; no file on disk is touched." = "它們會移至「最近刪除」，可以還原；磁碟上的檔案不會被更動。";
"They sign in to LightCraft on their devices with this user name and password, and get a library of their own. Letters, digits, dots, dashes and underscores in the name; at least 8 characters in the password, which you give them privately. Administrators can sign in to this page to manage users, devices and storage." = "他們會在自己的裝置上使用此使用者名稱和密碼登入 LightCraft，並取得屬於自己的照片庫。使用者名稱可包含字母、數字、句點、連字號和底線；密碼至少 8 個字元，由你私下告知對方。管理員可登入此頁面來管理使用者、裝置和儲存空間。";
